#### [High] All layers are built, but only one is shown
- **Where:** `data.layers.forEach` builds every layer; `display: none` hides them
- **Issue:** hidden nodes still exist in the DOM and still cost memory and parse time. Eleven of the twelve layers are never visible at load.
